  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are three vectors, such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and the angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
